### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Check the age of the last GenAI operation counter, exporter and Collector export errors. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Application telemetry stopped, a broken pipeline or an exporter failure.

### Fix
Restore metric export; an idle instrumented application should still export its cumulative counters.

### Verify
Fresh counter samples arrive and their age falls below the threshold. Detection requires a previously observed operation and stops after the 15-minute lookback. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
